---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="寻人启事" description="寻找那些能看穿迷雾的人">
  <section class="container" style="padding-top: 100px; text-align: center;">
    <p class="mono text-accent" style="letter-spacing: 0.4em; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 24px;">CONFIDENTIAL / WANTED</p>
    
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px); font-weight: 400; margin: 0; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);">
      致那些能看穿<br><span class="text-gold" style="font-style: italic; font-family: var(--serif);">迷雾</span>的人
    </h1>
    
    <p class="mono text-muted" style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">
      《雾都疑云》独立游戏开发组 · 悬赏招募
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="container divider">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2L15 9H22L16 14L18 21L12 16L6 21L8 14L2 9H9L12 2Z"/></svg>
  </div>

  <section class="container" style="display: grid; gap: 40px; align-items: start;">
    
    <!-- 左侧卷宗，取消死板的边框，用光影代替 -->
    <div class="dossier" style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">
      <p style="margin-top: 0; text-indent: 2em; color: #dcd3c6;">这不是一份寻常的雇佣合同。</p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em; color: #dcd3c6;">我目前正在用虚幻引擎5（UE5）重构一个1888年的伦敦。那里没有魔法，只有蔓延的浓雾、闪烁的煤气灯、未被揭开的凶案，以及一份份等着被写上真相的报纸。</p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em; color: #dcd3c6;">玩家将在这里扮演“情报掮客”，游走于街头巷尾，拼凑线索，将新闻卖给报社换取生存的筹码。</p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em; color: #dcd3c6;">我一个人在雾里摸索得有些久了。现在，我想找几个愿意一起进入这座城市的同伴。</p>
      
      <div style="margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);">
        <p style="margin: 4px 0;">STATUS: 初期原型搭建</p>
        <p style="margin: 4px 0;">ENGINE: Unreal Engine 5</p>
        <p style="margin: 4px 0;">TARGET: PC / Steam</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 右侧招募卷宗 -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="mono" style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">
        [ DOSSIERS / 招募卷宗 ]
      </h2>

      <div style="display: grid; gap: 24px;">
        <!-- 岗位 1 -->
        <div style="padding-left: 20px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500;">⚙️ 机械工匠</h3>
          <p class="mono text-muted" style="font-size: 11px; margin-top: 0; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">UE5 客户端 / 系统开发</p>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #a39b8d; line-height: 1.7;">懂蓝图或 C++。搭建城市底层规则——情报收集系统、报社字数结算系统、以及阴郁街头的交互逻辑。</p>
        </div>
        <!-- 岗位 2 -->
        <div style="padding-left: 20px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500;">🎨 光影画师</h3>
          <p class="mono text-muted" style="font-size: 11px; margin-top: 0; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">3D 美术 / 场景地编</p>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #a39b8d; line-height: 1.7;">需要构建湿冷、阴郁的伦敦街头。擅长老旧建筑、复古材质、维多利亚时期打光与氛围营造。</p>
        </div>
        <!-- 岗位 3 -->
        <div style="padding-left: 20px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500;">✒️ 迷雾说书人</h3>
          <p class="mono text-muted" style="font-size: 11px; margin-top: 0; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">剧情 / 系统策划</p>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #a39b8d; line-height: 1.7;">能写出让人脊背发凉的连环案件，设计“拼凑线索写出绝妙新闻”的机制。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container divider">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2L15 9H22L16 14L18 21L12 16L6 21L8 14L2 9H9L12 2Z"/></svg>
  </div>

  <!-- 底部接头区 -->
  <section class="container" style="text-align: center; padding: 20px 0 100px; position: relative;">
    
    <!-- 纯CSS火漆印章 -->
    <div style="width: 110px; height: 110px; margin: 0 auto 40px; background: radial-gradient(circle, #8a1c1c 0%, #4a0808 80%, #1a0202 100%); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 2px 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), inset 0 -8px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid #2a0404; transform: rotate(-12deg);">
      <div style="border: 2px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 50%; width: 85px; height: 85px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: var(--serif); color: #c48a8a; font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-shadow: 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);">
        密
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">如果你听懂了煤气灯下的暗号</h2>
    <p class="text-muted" style="margin-bottom: 40px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">请留下你的密信。这里没有大厂的傲慢，只有一群想做好东西的疯子。</p>
    
    <a href="mailto:hi@gongshui.com" style="display: inline-block; background: transparent; color: var(--gold); padding: 16px 48px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; border: 1px solid var(--gold); position: relative; overflow: hidden; transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.1);" onmouseover="this.style.background='var(--gold)'; this.style.color='#000'; this.style.boxShadow='0 0 30px rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.4)';" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'; this.style.color='var(--gold)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 0 20px rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.1)';">
      [ SEND TRANSMISSION ]
    </a>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
